      "message": "actually above sentence means, that before Host get notification about ACL disconnection it shall get notification about CIS disconnection.\nWhich confirms what I\u0027m saying: it is invalid behavior to get ACL disconnection complete event without getting CIS disconnection complete event and the fix is actually handling some invalid behavior.",
