      "message": "Hmmm the spec sentences were about Command, not Event, but I can agree that there could not be a explicit writing about \"mandatory\" event even for implicit disconnection request. \n\nIn term of event order there may be some flexibility. I saw in Core 5.3 `6.24 ACL DISCONNECTED` that hosts may receive event in different order - ACL disconnection first.\n\nSo I think that this part remains valid for every case - maybe comment can be redacted to `It is possible that ACL disconnection came before CIS....`",
